---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
	title="About — 332"
	description="Invite-only Discord community since 2020, grown from IRC roots. Posts, ethos, and how to approach us."
>
	<div>
		<div>
			<div>
				<h1>About 332</h1>
				<p>
					332 started on IRC and moved to Discord in 2020. It was
					originally a place for us to chat and share ideas, but it
					quickly grew into so much more.
				</p>
			</div>

			<section>
				<h2>Who we are</h2>

				<div>
					<iframe
						src="https://app.order332.com/share/-yCgMBOvrHb-MQ-mC553jfYsinX8ptlnzjW0xEw0DRM/embed"
						title="332 Trailer"
						loading="lazy"
						allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
						referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
						scrolling="no"
					></iframe>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>What we stand for</h2>
				<div>
					<div>
						<div>
							<svg
								xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
								width="18"
								height="18"
								viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								fill="none"
								stroke="currentColor"
								stroke-width="1.5"
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
							>
								<path
									d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"
								></path>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Freedom</h3>
						<p>
							Because 332 is private, freedom of speech and
							expression reigns supreme. You can say whatever you
							want, however you want, without the fear of being
							banned or silenced<sup>*</sup>. This doesn't mean
							you can't be held accountable for your actions,
							though.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div>
						<div>
							<svg
								xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
								width="20"
								height="20"
								viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								fill="none"
								stroke="currentColor"
								stroke-width="1.5"
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
							>
								<circle cx="12" cy="10" r="6"></circle>
								<path d="M9 16l-2 4"></path>
								<path d="M15 16l2 4"></path>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Winning at life</h3>
						<p>
							332 was built to outlast, to win, and to be the
							best. If that's you, then we have something in
							common. You don't need to have "made it", to join.
							If anything, it's the drive to make it that makes
							you a good fit for 332.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div>
						<div>
							<svg
								xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
								width="18"
								height="18"
								viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								fill="none"
								stroke="currentColor"
								stroke-width="1.5"
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
							>
								<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
								<path
									d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"
								></path>
								<path d="M2 12h20"></path>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Being truly global</h3>
						<p>
							In the eyes of 332, the world has no borders, and
							neither do we. Members of 332 come from every corner
							of the world including North America, Europe, Asia,
							the Middle East, and more.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div>
						<div>
							<svg
								xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
								width="18"
								height="18"
								viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								fill="none"
								stroke="currentColor"
								stroke-width="1.5"
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
							>
								<rect
									width="18"
									height="11"
									x="3"
									y="11"
									rx="2"
									ry="2"
								></rect>
								<path
									d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"
								></path>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Mutual trust</h3>
						<p>
							Because 332 is private and relies on trust, what is
							said in 332 must stay in 332. This keeps our
							community safe and secure and it's the only golden
							rule of 332.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section>
				<div>
					<h2>Want in?</h2>
					<p>
						332 is a private community. If you've been invited—or
						know someone who can vouch for you—use the link below to
						join. If you don't have an invite but are interested in
						joining, you can also apply using the same link.
					</p>
					<a
						href="https://discord.gg/WuGrkMZeNG"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						Join on Discord
						<svg
							xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
							stroke-width="2"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
						>
							<path
								d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"
							></path>
							<polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
							<line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
						</svg>
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<p>
				* As a Discord server, we have to abide by Discord's terms
				of service and community guidelines. If you repeatedly
				breach Discord's guidelines, you may be banned from the
				server.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<footer>
		<div>
			<div>
				<img src="/polygon.svg" alt="332" width="20" height="20" />
				<span>332</span>
			</div>
			<div>
				<a href="/">Home</a>
				<a href="/about">About</a>
				<a href="/blog">Blog</a>
			</div>
			<p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 332</p>
		</div>
	</footer>
</PageLayout>
